╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│                                                                │
│  Keyboard shortcuts                                            │
│                                                                │
│    ↑ / k           Move selection up                           │
│    ↓ / j           Move selection down                         │
│    home / g        Jump to first resource                      │
│    end / G         Jump to last resource                       │
│    pgup / pgdown   Page up / page down                         │
│                                                                │
│    /               Filter resources (substring or key=value)   │
│    esc             Clear filter, then back to project picker,  │
│  then dismiss help                                             │
│    tab             Switch project (multi-project scans)        │
│    s               Cycle sort: cost ↓ → address ↑ → type ↑     │
│    r               Refresh — re-run the scan, bypassing the    │
│  cache                                                         │
│    e               Open the selected resource in $EDITOR       │
│    a               Re-authenticate (only on the error screen)  │
│                                                                │
│    ?               Toggle this help                            │
│    q / ctrl+c      Quit                                        │
│                                                                │
│  Press ? or esc to close.                                      │
│                                                                │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯